    - Term: ads.keep_optional_ads
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Keep optional ads for rewards
      - "Gi\u1EEF qu\u1EA3ng c\xE1o t\xF9y ch\u1ECDn \u0111\u1EC3 nh\u1EADn th\u01B0\u1EDFng."
      - "\u4FDD\u7559\u53EF\u9009\u5E7F\u544A\u4EE5\u63D0\u4F9B\u5956\u52B1\u3002"
